---
title: "Greenlight — Scan Sequence · the 18 seconds the judge watches"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Creator
  participant UI as Report UI
  participant API as /api/scan
  participant ORC as Orchestrator
  participant FF as ffmpeg
  participant ASR as Groq Whisper
  participant VIS as Vision
  participant DET as Candidates
  participant GATE as Adjudicator + Gate
  participant CACHE as Scan cache

  C->>UI: drops input.mp4 (+ title, thumbnail)
  UI->>API: POST multipart
  API->>ORC: startScan
  ORC->>CACHE: lookup sha256 + pack_version
  alt cache hit (all 3 sample clips)
    CACHE-->>UI: full report · ~200ms
    Note over UI,CACHE: judge-mode path · zero API calls · cannot fail live
  else cache miss
    ORC->>FF: probe + extract audio + keyframes
    FF-->>ORC: audio.wav, frames/*.jpg  (~3s)
    par perception runs in parallel
      ORC->>ASR: transcribe, word granularity
      ASR-->>ORC: transcript.json  (~6s)
    and
      ORC->>VIS: 5 batched calls, 8 frames each
      VIS-->>ORC: descriptors.json  (~8s)
    end
    ORC->>DET: generate candidates (local, <100ms)
    DET-->>ORC: candidates.json
    ORC->>GATE: adjudicate against clause text
    GATE->>GATE: Zod parse → allowlist check
    GATE-->>ORC: findings.json + drops.jsonl  (~6s)
    ORC->>ORC: computeVerdict (pure, <10ms)
    ORC->>CACHE: persist
    ORC-->>UI: stream progress → full report
  end
  UI-->>C: timeline banded red/amber/green

  Note over C,UI: every finding shows evidence,<br/>clause id, effective date, source link

  C->>UI: reviews findings, deselects any false positive
  C->>API: POST /api/fix with approved plan
  API->>FF: single filter_complex pass
  FF-->>API: fixed.mp4  (~4s for a 3-min clip)
  API->>ORC: auto re-scan fixed.mp4 (new hash)
  ORC-->>UI: timeline green
  UI-->>C: download fixed.mp4 + report.json + self-cert sheet
